            <!--
              Quick Puppet Surface Pins: one alpha-clipped character surface
              with more than three arbitrary controls. Rigid MLS keeps the
              character volume stable while head, neck, torso, limb joints,
              both hands, and both feet remain directly draggable.
            -->
